            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Meeting summaries no longer get stuck.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.18</h2>
<ul>
  <li>A meeting that ended while your sign-in was renewing now gets its summary automatically.</li>
  <li>The Summary and Transcript tabs line up with the meeting title.</li>
  <li>The people count no longer adds an extra "Them".</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
